---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: January 2026</p>

    <p>
      At StackCost Matrix, accessible from stackcost.apexcraftweb.com, the privacy of our visitors is of paramount importance to us. 
      This Privacy Policy document outlines the types of information that is collected and recorded by our platform and how we use it.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mt-6">Analytics and Web Data</h2>
    <p>
      We use lightweight, privacy-friendly analytics to track aggregate website usage (such as total pageviews and popular comparison pages). 
      We do not use invasive cross-site tracking cookies, nor do we harvest or sell your personal information to third-party data brokers.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mt-6">Third-Party Links & Checkouts</h2>
    <p>
      Our website contains links to external software vendors and digital marketplaces (including Gumroad). 
      When you navigate to an external website, their respective privacy policies govern your interactions and payment details.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
